silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_17_commutative_diagrams_as_governance_concrete_anchor_2_square_17#governancesquare17 silm:hasLongDescription "The GovernanceSquare17 is the same square read as paper-17 governance. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'square_17', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
